{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211540","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211540","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121154001:1":{"text":"탈렌 양, 괜찮아요? 악마는 찾았나요?","source_cn":"塔琳小姐，你没事吧？找到恶魔了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD85D5BE1191CC5C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121154002:1":{"text":"미안해요... 제가 이곳에 도착했을 때 이미 악마의 흔적은 사라지고 없었어요.","source_cn":"抱歉，我来到这里时，已经没有恶魔的踪影了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x017046B3A21A852F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121154003:1":{"text":"오히려 그 악마의 부하들이 갑자기 나타나서 일부러 제 추적을 늦추려는 것 같았죠.","source_cn":"那些恶魔的眷属反而突然出现，好像有意要拖延我的追踪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05C25593C75A8B0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121154004:2":{"text":"그럼, 탈렌 양, 아직도 악마의 기운이 느껴지나요?","source_cn":"那，塔琳小姐，你现在还能感受到恶魔气息吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBF5CEFADDCDAE07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121154005:1":{"text":"아니요... 사라졌어요.","source_cn":"已经找不到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729A6C4219DB1BC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121154006:1":{"text":"오는 길에 엘로나가 주변을 살펴보았는데 달빛 그림자에 별다른 변화는 없었어요.","source_cn":"来的路上，艾洛娜留意过四周，月影乡没有其他变化。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08819207A3134FDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121154007:0":{"text":"음, 그럼 어떡하죠... 여기서 계속 기다린다고 악마가 다시 나타난다는 보장도 없고...","source_cn":"唔，那怎么办呢……即便在这里继续守候，恶魔也不一定会再...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39ADA2EF6BC1B199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1121154007":{"text":"음, 그럼 어떡하죠... 여기서 계속 기다린다고 악마가 다시 나타난다는 보장도 없고...","source_cn":"唔，那怎么办呢……即便这里继续守候，恶魔也不一定会再在这里出现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39ADA2EF6BC1B199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121154008:0":{"text":"엘로나에게 계속해서 경계하라고 하겠습니다.","source_cn":"我会让艾洛娜继续警戒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x618D4C7BEC88FCC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121154009:1":{"text":"여러분, 가시죠.","source_cn":"诸位，请。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EA2594EC6211EF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"경계를 늦추지 말고 우선은 영